        "Clicking the Loose Sand spawns an NM Antlion around level 55 named Lioumere . The spawning player will be hit with Pit Ambush upon spawning. Half of Lioumere's TP moves are physical while the sand named ones are Earth , and it is weakest to Wind and Light . After Lioumere uses a TP move (like Sandblast or Sandtrap), it will return to the Loose Sand and recover all its HP. So it is recommended to pull it away from the Loose Sand after spawning. Sleep , Bind , Stun , Gravity and a multitude of other Enfeebles will land and help prevent it from returning to the Loose Sand .",
