        "You will have exactly 30 Earth minutes to climb to the top of Parradamo Tor and reach the Cradle of Rebirth before the Mimeo Jewel breaks .",
        "The Jewel will also IMMEDIATELY BREAK upon using a Mount , zoning, disconnecting, or using a Nexus Cape while in same area, as it counts as zoning.",
        "If the Jewel breaks, you will need to return to the Loose Sand and obtain another Mimeo Jewel . You will not have to re-fight the NM.",
