        "Note: Blackened Siredon is an item that is used to stop the Mithran Trackers TP gain for a short amount of time. If you wish to obtain these items, you need to complete the quest Mithran Delicacies given by Anguenet at (J-10) in Carpenters' Landing . This quest is entirely optional.",
