        "In addition, all forms can use Tremorous Tread: Low AoE damage with a Stun effect, absorbed by Utsusemi.",
        "Transmogrification: Absorbs all physical damage for ~30 seconds. Effect also absorbs all physical damage including weaponskills and special abilities.",
